From: William Emerison Six <billsix@gmail.com>
Date: Mon, 7 Sep 2026 22:22:44 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 1479/3799] soh: rename D_80A69248 -> sPathPoints

Name source: DEDUCED from the code (confidence HIGH) -- zeldaret/oot
leaves this symbol address-named too, so there is no upstream name to adopt.
Reason: the fourteen waypoints the phantom horse gallops between, each carrying an XYZ position and the speed to hold on the way to it.
Defined in soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_En_Horse_Ganon/z_en_horse_ganon.c.

Tagged [LLM:HIGH] at the definition, every declaration and every call site, so a
reader meeting the name anywhere knows it is inferred.
---
 .../actors/ovl_En_Horse_Ganon/z_en_horse_ganon.c         | 9 +++++----
 1 file changed, 5 insertions(+), 4 deletions(-)

diff --git a/soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_En_Horse_Ganon/z_en_horse_ganon.c b/soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_En_Horse_Ganon/z_en_horse_ganon.c
